        <div class="stat"><div class="stat-n">⭐ Gold</div><div class="stat-l">Odoo Partner</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-text">
      <p>E-TripleSoft is a leading technology company specializing in comprehensive digital transformation. From Odoo ERP implementation and AI automation to custom web &amp; mobile development, cloud security, and digital marketing — we deliver end-to-end solutions tailored to your business.</p>
      <p>With offices in Egypt, Saudi Arabia, and the UAE, our certified experts partner with businesses of all sizes to streamline operations and accelerate growth. We're here to help at every stage of your journey.</p>
      <p><em>Ready to transform your business? Get in touch — let's build something great together.</em></p>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">Odoo ERP</span>
        <span class="tag">AI Automation</span>
        <span class="tag">Digital Marketing</span>
        <span class="tag">Web Development</span>
        <span class="tag">Mobile Apps</span>
        <span class="tag">Cloud &amp; Security</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

