      <div class="sstep"><div class="sstep-num">02</div><div class="sstep-body"><h4>AI Model Design &amp; Selection</h4><p>Our team selects the right AI models and automation frameworks &mdash; from RPA and NLP to machine learning and computer vision.</p></div></div>
