      "description": "Etriplesoft provides professional mobile app development services for Android and iOS across Egypt, UAE, and Saudi Arabia. We design, develop, test, and deploy scalable, secure, and custom mobile applications tailored to business growth and digital transformation.",
      "url": "https://etriplesoft.com/mobile-apps-services/",
      "provider": {
