 <span class="section-label">TAX COMPLIANCE</span>
 <h2 class="section-title">Built-in Tax Compliance<br>for Egypt, Saudi Arabia &amp; UAE</h2>
 <p class="section-body">Our <strong style="color:#eaf0f6;">Odoo ERP Egypt</strong> implementation includes full ETA e-invoicing compliance from day one. As the #1 <strong style="color:#eaf0f6;">ERP system Egypt</strong> teams deploy for tax compliance, Odoo is pre-configured for ETA, ZATCA, and FTA — Etriplesoft handles every localisation so your business is compliant from go-live.</p>
