 <div class="tax-country-card">
 <div class="tax-country-header"><span class="tax-flag">🇪🇬</span><div><div class="tax-country-name">Egypt</div><div class="tax-country-sub">مصلحة الضرائب المصرية</div></div><span class="tax-badge">ETA</span></div>
 <div class="tax-items">
 <div class="tax-item"><div class="tax-item-icon">🧾</div><div class="tax-item-body"><div class="tax-item-title">E-Invoicing (ETA)</div><div class="tax-item-desc">Odoo integrates with Egypt Tax Authority's e-invoicing portal — digital signatures, XML submission, and real-time status tracking.</div></div></div>
 <div class="tax-item"><div class="tax-item-icon">📊</div><div class="tax-item-body"><div class="tax-item-title">VAT — 14%</div><div class="tax-item-desc">Standard VAT rate configured with automatic tax line application on sales, purchases, and service invoices.</div></div></div>
 <div class="tax-item"><div class="tax-item-icon">🏦</div><div class="tax-item-body"><div class="tax-item-title">Withholding Tax</div><div class="tax-item-desc">Automatic deduction and reporting for salary and supplier withholding tax as per Egyptian Tax Authority rules.</div></div></div>
 <div class="tax-item"><div class="tax-item-icon">💼</div><div class="tax-item-body"><div class="tax-item-title">Payroll &amp; Social Insurance</div><div class="tax-item-desc">Egyptian progressive income tax brackets and social insurance contributions calculated automatically in payslips.</div></div></div>
 </div>
 <div class="tax-authority"><span>🏛️</span><span>Authority: <strong>Egyptian Tax Authority (ETA)</strong> — eta.gov.eg</span></div>
