<!-- WHY ODOO — PRIMARY: "Odoo ERP Egypt" x2, SECONDARY: "ERP system Egypt" x1, "Odoo ERP for SMEs Egypt" x1 -->
<section class="why-odoo" id="why-odoo">
 <div style="position:absolute;width:600px;height:600px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(123,94,167,.07) 0%,transparent 65%);top:-150px;right:-150px;pointer-events:none;"></div>
 <div style="position:absolute;width:400px;height:400px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(0,198,255,.06) 0%,transparent 65%);bottom:-80px;left:-80px;pointer-events:none;"></div>
 <div class="container">
 <span class="section-label">Why Odoo + Etriplesoft</span>
 <h2 class="section-title">One Platform. Every Business Function<br>— Built for <span style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00d4ff,#9b6dff);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;">Odoo ERP Egypt</span></h2>
 <div class="why-two-col">
 <div>
 <p class="why-left-body"><strong style="color:#eaf0f6;">Odoo ERP Egypt</strong> is powered by Odoo — an open-source ERP platform used by millions of businesses worldwide. It covers every core function — accounting, CRM, inventory, HR, manufacturing, e-commerce, and more — in a single connected system. As the leading <strong style="color:#eaf0f6;">ERP system Egypt</strong> businesses choose, Odoo combines world-class technology with full ETA, ZATCA, and FTA compliance.</p>
 <p class="why-left-body">Unlike rigid enterprise software, Odoo is fully modular. Egyptian SMEs and enterprises start with the apps they need today and expand as the business grows — without switching platforms or losing data. This is why <strong style="color:#eaf0f6;">Odoo ERP for SMEs Egypt</strong> is the fastest-growing ERP choice in the region.</p>
 <div class="why-hosting-row">
 <div class="why-badge2">☁️ Odoo SaaS</div>
 <div class="why-badge2">🛠️ Odoo.sh</div>
 <div class="why-badge2">🖥️ On-Premise</div>
 <div class="why-badge2">⚡ AWS / Azure</div>
 </div>
