 <p style="max-width:660px">Each market has distinct regulatory requirements. Etriplesoft configures Odoo to be fully compliant in all three markets from day one — no extra modules, no additional cost. Here is exactly what is included per country.</p>

 <div class="comp-grid">

 <!-- ═══ EGYPT ═══ -->
