 <div class="comp-divider"></div>
 <p>Egypt's construction sector is one of the most active in the MENA region, driven by national infrastructure programmes and the New Administrative Capital. <strong>Construction ERP software Egypt</strong> must handle ETA e-invoicing for all IPC and supplier transactions — a mandatory regulatory requirement.</p>
 <div class="comp-point">
 <span class="comp-point-label">ETA E-Invoicing</span>
 <p>All construction invoices — IPC payments, supplier bills, and subcontractor transactions — are validated, signed, and transmitted to the Egyptian Tax Authority portal in real time with UUID generation and credit note handling fully automated.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="comp-point">
 <span class="comp-point-label">Egyptian Labour Law</span>
 <p>Worker compensation, subcontractor payroll, and social insurance contributions for site-based employees are configured inside <a href="https://etriplesoft.com/odoo-hr-software/" style="color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600">Odoo for HR</a> — linked directly to project cost accounts in the platform.</p>
 </div>
