 </div>
 <div class="comp-divider comp-divider-uae"></div>
 <p>The UAE construction market — led by Dubai and Abu Dhabi mega-developments — demands <strong>construction project management software Dubai</strong> that handles VAT 5%, retentions, letters of guarantee, and RERA project documentation simultaneously. Etriplesoft configures all of it from day one.</p>
 <div class="comp-point">
