 <div class="vis-tag">Subcontractors &amp; IPC</div>
 <h3>Subcontractor Management &amp; IPC Billing — From Work Order to Payment</h3>
 <p>Every subcontractor work order issued inside this <strong>construction management platform</strong> is tracked from assignment through progress verification to payment release — with milestone-based IPC billing generated automatically once work completion is certified by the site team.</p>
 <p>Retention amounts, advance payment deductions, and performance bond tracking are all managed within the same system — connected directly to <strong>Odoo for Accounting</strong> so every certified IPC posts to the financial ledger instantly without manual journal entries.</p>
 </div>
