 <div class="vis-tag">Tax &amp; Compliance</div>
 <h3>ETA, ZATCA &amp; UAE VAT Compliance — All Three Markets Built In</h3>
 <p>Every construction invoice, IPC, and subcontractor payment generated in Odoo is automatically compliant with the tax regulations of all three markets — Egypt ETA e-invoicing, ZATCA Phase 2 for Saudi Arabia, and UAE VAT 5% — with zero manual tax preparation required.</p>
 <p>This connects directly to <a href="https://etriplesoft.com/odoo-hr-software/" style="color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600">Odoo for HR</a> for GOSI payroll compliance in Saudi Arabia and Egyptian Labour Law requirements, and to <strong>Odoo for Accounting</strong> for live financial reporting across all three countries from one instance.</p>
 </div>
