 <p style="margin-top:1.4rem;">Translations are available out of the box for the full <strong>Odoo Insight and Control</strong> suite, and Etriplesoft can extend, localise, or correct any translation for your <strong>Odoo dashboard &amp; insights</strong> based on your regional dialect — especially important for finance and HR terminology across Egypt, KSA, UAE, and the wider Arab world.</p>
 </section>

