<section class="sec">
<div class="wrap">
 <div class="eye">Overview</div>
 <h2>What Is Odoo Real Estate Software?</h2>
 <p style="max-width:720px;font-size:17px"><strong>Odoo real estate software</strong> is a fully integrated ERP platform that connects every layer of a property business — from CRM lead management and property listings through lease contract automation, maintenance management, and real-time financial reporting — all inside one connected system. Whether you are looking for <strong>Odoo real estate Egypt</strong>, <strong>property management software Dubai</strong>, or a <strong>real estate ERP Saudi Arabia</strong> solution, Etriplesoft configures the right setup from day one.</p>
 <p style="max-width:720px">Unlike standalone property management tools that cover only leasing and invoicing, <strong>odoo real estate software</strong> includes native CRM, full accounting, maintenance management, payroll, and business intelligence — making it a complete business operating system, not just a property tool. Every lease contract generates an invoice. Every maintenance request is linked to a property cost centre. Every agent deal is tracked against a live sales pipeline — all in one platform.</p>
 <p style="max-width:720px">At <strong>Etriplesoft</strong>, as a certified <strong>Odoo Gold Partner</strong>, our Odoo implementation service for real estate companies is built around how property businesses actually operate across Egypt, UAE, and Saudi Arabia. We configure CRM pipelines, lease templates, recurring invoicing, RERA compliance workflows, Ejari automation, Ejar integration, and ETA e-invoicing from day one — so your team goes live without workarounds.</p>
 <a href="https://etriple.odoo.com/appointment/3" class="btn" style="margin-top:8px">Request a Free Demo →</a>
 <div class="qstrip">
 <div class="qs"><div class="qs-i">🏠</div><div class="qs-t">Property Portfolio</div><p class="qs-p">Centralised database of all units, buildings, and land parcels with live status tracking — available, reserved, sold, or leased — across all your locations.</p></div>
 <div class="qs"><div class="qs-i">📝</div><div class="qs-t">Lease Automation</div><p class="qs-p">Auto-generate contracts, track renewals, and send expiry alerts. Tenancy law compliance for UAE, KSA, and Egypt — built in from day one of your Odoo implementation.</p></div>
 <div class="qs"><div class="qs-i">💳</div><div class="qs-t">Smart Invoicing</div><p class="qs-p">Recurring rent invoices sent automatically with payment matching and overdue follow-ups. UAE VAT, ZATCA Phase 2, and ETA e-invoicing all configured at go-live.</p></div>
 <div class="qs"><div class="qs-i">🔑</div><div class="qs-t">CRM &amp; Pipeline</div><p class="qs-p">Visual deal pipeline from first enquiry to signed contract. Automated follow-up sequences, agent performance dashboards, and commission calculation built in.</p></div>
 <div class="qs"><div class="qs-i">🔧</div><div class="qs-t">Maintenance Portal</div><p class="qs-p">Tenant request portal, work order assignment, and preventive maintenance scheduling. Pairs directly with <a href="https://etriplesoft.com/odoo-facility-management-software/" style="color:var(--cyan)">Odoo for Facility Management</a> for full FM control.</p></div>
 <div class="qs"><div class="qs-i">🌍</div><div class="qs-t">Multi-Branch Ready</div><p class="qs-p">Manage unlimited offices and portfolios from one Odoo instance with consolidated reporting per branch, per city, or across all markets simultaneously.</p></div>
 </div>
</div>
</section>
