<section class="sec" style="background:var(--bg2)">
<div class="wrap">
 <div class="eye">Local Compliance</div>
 <h2>Odoo Real Estate Software — Egypt, UAE &amp; Saudi Arabia Compliance Built In</h2>
 <p style="max-width:660px">Every market has its own regulatory requirements. Etriplesoft configures <strong>Odoo real estate software</strong> to be fully compliant in all three markets from day one — no extra modules, no additional cost. Here is exactly what is included per country.</p>
 <div class="comp-grid">
 <!-- Egypt -->
 <div class="comp-card">
 <div class="comp-flag">🇪🇬</div>
 <h3>Odoo Real Estate Software Egypt</h3>
 <p>Egypt's property market operates under specific ETA e-invoicing mandates and lease law requirements that every property business must meet. Etriplesoft configures <strong>property management software Egypt</strong> with full compliance from day one.</p>
 <p><strong>ETA E-Invoicing:</strong> All rent invoices and property sale contracts are validated, signed, and transmitted automatically to the Egyptian Tax Authority portal in real time — B2B and B2C supported with full UUID generation and credit note handling.</p>
 <p><strong>Lease Law Compliance:</strong> Egyptian tenancy law provisions on contract duration, renewal notice periods, and rental escalation are built into every lease template. No manual legal review required on renewal.</p>
 <p><strong>Arabic Interface:</strong> Full Arabic UI for your Egyptian operations team — right-to-left layout, Arabic property descriptions, and bilingual contract generation all supported natively.</p>
 <div class="comp-tags">
 <span class="comp-tag">ETA e-Invoicing</span>
 <span class="comp-tag">Arabic UI</span>
 <span class="comp-tag">EGP Currency</span>
 <span class="comp-tag">Lease Law</span>
 </div>
 </div>
 <!-- UAE -->
 <div class="comp-card" style="border-top-color:var(--cyan)">
 <div class="comp-flag">🇦🇪</div>
 <h3>Odoo Real Estate Software UAE</h3>
 <p>The UAE real estate market is one of the most regulated in the world. Dubai brokerages require RERA licensing compliance. Dubai developers must track DLD registration fees and Ejari tenancy contracts. Etriplesoft configures <strong>property management software Dubai</strong> and across the UAE to handle all of it automatically.</p>
 <p><strong>RERA Compliance:</strong> Agent license tracking, RERA-required fee structures, and Form A/B/F documentation are all manageable within Odoo's CRM and contract modules — configured to Dubai and Abu Dhabi regulatory requirements.</p>
 <p><strong>Ejari Integration:</strong> Tenancy contracts are formatted and filed to meet Ejari registration requirements. Automated alerts ensure no contract misses its Ejari filing window — critical for Dubai landlords and property managers.</p>
 <p><strong>UAE VAT 5% &amp; FTA Returns:</strong> Full VAT calculation on commercial property transactions, automatic FTA return preparation, and DLD transaction fee tracking built in.</p>
 <div class="comp-tags">
 <span class="comp-tag">RERA Compliant</span>
 <span class="comp-tag">Ejari Ready</span>
 <span class="comp-tag">UAE VAT 5%</span>
 <span class="comp-tag">DLD Tracking</span>
 </div>
 </div>
 <!-- KSA -->
 <div class="comp-card" style="border-top-color:var(--green)">
 <div class="comp-flag">🇸🇦</div>
 <h3>Odoo Real Estate Software Saudi Arabia</h3>
 <p>Saudi Arabia's Vision 2030 is driving a major transformation in real estate. With NEOM, The Red Sea Project, and Qiddiya redefining the market, Saudi property businesses need ERP software built for scale, compliance, and the Kingdom's specific regulatory standards. Etriplesoft configures <strong>real estate ERP Saudi Arabia</strong> with everything REGA and ZATCA require.</p>
 <p><strong>Ejar Integration:</strong> Saudi Arabia's mandatory lease registration system — Ejar — is fully supported. Lease contracts are formatted, submitted, and tracked through Ejar workflows automatically, reducing compliance risk on every tenancy agreement.</p>
 <p><strong>ZATCA Phase 2 E-Invoicing:</strong> All property sale and rental invoices are generated and validated through ZATCA's Fatoora portal in real time. QR codes, XML generation, and cryptographic signing are handled automatically — 100% ZATCA Phase 2 compliant.</p>
 <p><strong>REGA Compliance:</strong> Real Estate General Authority requirements for property registration, broker licensing, and transaction reporting are supported through Odoo's document management and CRM modules.</p>
