 <div class="vis-txt">
 <div class="vis-tag">Field Service</div>
 <h3>Dispatch Technicians &amp; Track SLA Compliance Across All Sites</h3>
 <p>Odoo's field service module connects your operations centre to every technician on the ground. Managers assign jobs, track real-time progress, and receive completion reports instantly — while technicians use the Odoo mobile app to view assignments, log time, capture photos, and close work orders on-site.</p>
 <p>Combined with the helpdesk module, your <strong>facility management software</strong> handles all client and tenant requests with full SLA tracking and automated escalation — critical for FM contractors managing service level agreements across multiple client contracts.</p>
 </div>
