<!-- ══════════ CHALLENGES ══════════ -->
<section class="sec" style="background:var(--bg2)">
<div class="wrap">
 <div class="eye">The Problem</div>
 <h2>FM Challenges That Odoo Facility Management Software Solves</h2>
 <p style="max-width:660px">Facility management businesses across Egypt, UAE, and Saudi Arabia share the same operational pressures. Here is exactly how <strong>odoo facility management software</strong> — properly configured by Etriplesoft — eliminates each one. Whether you need a <strong>CMMS replacement</strong>, a <strong>CAFM system</strong>, or a full FM-ERP integration, the answer is the same platform.</p>
 <div class="chg">
 <div class="chc"><div class="chi">🗂️</div><h3>Disconnected CMMS, CAFM &amp; ERP Systems</h3><p>When your maintenance software, asset register, and accounting run as separate tools, data gaps and duplicate errors multiply. <strong>Odoo facility management software</strong> replaces all three with one connected platform — every work order posts to accounts automatically.</p></div>
 <div class="chc"><div class="chi">🔧</div><h3>Reactive Maintenance &amp; Unplanned Downtime</h3><p>Without automated preventive maintenance scheduling, your team responds to breakdowns rather than preventing them. <strong>Odoo FM software</strong> automates every recurring inspection and service task so critical assets like HVAC, elevators, and fire systems are always serviced on schedule.</p></div>
 <div class="chc"><div class="chi">📋</div><h3>Manual Work Orders &amp; Paper Job Cards</h3><p>Paper-based dispatch and phone-based work order management is slow and impossible to track at scale. A structured <strong>Odoo implementation</strong> replaces all of this with digital workflows, mobile completion, and full audit trails from day one.</p></div>
 <div class="chc"><div class="chi">📊</div><h3>No Live Cost Visibility Across Buildings</h3><p>Without real-time cost tracking, maintenance budgets creep past projections unnoticed. <strong>odoo facility management software</strong> gives operations managers live cost visibility per building, asset type, and service category — with automatic budget alerts before overspend occurs.</p></div>
 <div class="chc"><div class="chi">🏢</div><h3>Multi-Site Complexity Without Consolidated Reporting</h3><p>Coordinating technicians, spare parts, and reporting manually across multiple buildings is error-prone and time-consuming. <strong>Odoo FM software</strong> gives you a unified real-time view of every site from a single dashboard — without switching between systems.</p></div>
 <div class="chc"><div class="chi">🤝</div><h3>SLA Breaches &amp; Poor Client Communication</h3><p>Without a structured helpdesk, responding to tenant and client requests is inconsistent and undocumented. Missing SLA deadlines damages contract renewals. <strong>Odoo facility management software</strong> automates SLA countdown timers, escalations, and client status updates from day one.</p></div>
 </div>
</div>
</section>

