 See your FM workflows live in Odoo — in a free 45-minute demo built around your buildings and contracts.
 </h3>

 <p style="font-size:14px;color:#7A9DC8;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:26px">
 We will walk through your maintenance workflows, asset structure, SLA contracts, and compliance requirements — and show you exactly what your implementation would deliver. You will leave with a clear picture and a fixed-price scope, not a sales pitch.
 </p>

