<div class="wrap">
 <div class="eye">Who Is It For</div>
 <h2>Odoo FM Software Works for Every Type of Facilities Business</h2>
 <p style="max-width:660px">Whether you manage a single commercial tower or operate as a multi-client FM contractor across Egypt, UAE, and Saudi Arabia, our <strong>odoo facility management software</strong> scales precisely to your portfolio and operational model.</p>
