<!-- ══════════ WHY ETRIPLESOFT ══════════ -->
<section class="sec">
<div class="wrap">
 <div class="eye">Why Choose Us</div>
 <h2>Why FM Companies Choose Etriplesoft — Odoo Gold Partner</h2>
 <p style="max-width:700px">Etriplesoft is a certified <strong>Odoo Gold Partner</strong> with proven delivery experience across <strong>Odoo facility management software</strong> implementation projects in Egypt, UAE, and Saudi Arabia. Every <strong>Odoo implementation</strong> we deliver is precisely configured to your maintenance workflows, asset structure, SLA contracts, and compliance obligations — not a generic ERP rollout.</p>
 <p style="max-width:700px">Our FM-specialist Odoo consultants guide your team through every stage — from requirement scoping and CMMS migration to asset data import, team training, and your first live month-end close — with dedicated support at every step. We also integrate your FM system with <a href="https://etriplesoft.com/odoo-hr-software/" style="color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600">Odoo for HR</a> for technician payroll and with <a href="https://etriplesoft.com/odoo-for-accounting/" style="color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600">Odoo for Accounting</a> for full financial integration from day one.</p>
 <p style="max-width:700px">Demand for structured facility management is accelerating fast in <strong>Saudi Arabia</strong>, driven by Vision 2030 giga-projects and mandatory <strong>ZATCA Phase 2 e-invoicing</strong> for VAT-registered businesses. Etriplesoft configures Odoo FM deployments to meet Saudi compliance and reporting requirements from day one — the same certified delivery standard we apply across Egypt and the UAE.</p>

 <div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:rgba(252,211,77,.10);border:1.5px solid rgba(252,211,77,.3);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;margin-bottom:28px">
 <span style="font-size:22px">🏆</span>
 <div>
 <div style="font-size:.85rem;font-weight:800;color:#FCD34D">Odoo Gold Partner — Certified</div>
 <div style="font-size:.75rem;color:rgba(252,211,77,.6)">Serving Egypt · UAE · Saudi Arabia · Verified at odoo.com/partners</div>
 </div>
 <a href="https://www.odoo.com/partners/e-triplesoft-10996064" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="margin-left:12px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;color:#FCD34D;white-space:nowrap">View Profile →</a>
 </div>

 <div class="whyg">
 <div class="whyc"><div class="wyn">10+</div><div class="wyt">Years ERP Experience</div><p class="wyd">Deep FM and maintenance implementation expertise across Egypt, UAE, and Saudi Arabia</p></div>
 <div class="whyc"><div class="wyn">250+</div><div class="wyt">Implementations Delivered</div><p class="wyd">Proven Odoo delivery track record across MENA region businesses of every size</p></div>
 <div class="whyc"><div class="wyn">Gold</div><div class="wyt">Odoo Certified Partner</div><p class="wyd">Gold Partner status delivering Odoo v17 with full UAE VAT, ZATCA, and ETA compliance</p></div>
 <div class="whyc"><div class="wyn">24/7</div><div class="wyt">Ongoing Support</div><p class="wyd">Dedicated post-implementation support keeping your FM operations running without disruption</p></div>
 </div>
</div>
</section>

