 <h2>Odoo Facility Management Software in Action</h2>
 <p style="max-width:640px">From the first maintenance request to the final asset compliance report — see how a fully configured <strong>odoo facility management software</strong> system connects every part of your operations across Egypt, UAE, and Saudi Arabia.</p>

 <div class="vis-grid">
 <div class="vis-row">
 <div class="vis-txt">
 <div class="vis-tag">Maintenance Module</div>
 <h3>Real-Time CMMS — Work Orders, Preventive Schedules &amp; Asset Compliance</h3>
 <p><strong>Odoo facility management software</strong> delivers full computerized maintenance management system (CMMS) capabilities out of the box. Corrective work orders, preventive maintenance schedules, asset inspections, and compliance reminders are all managed from one module — with automated technician assignments and mobile job completion built in.</p>
 <p>This is what facility managers running disconnected CMMS tools gain when they move to a full <strong>Odoo implementation</strong>: every maintenance record is linked to the asset, the contract, the cost centre, and the technician — in one traceable audit trail.</p>
 </div>
