 <div class="vis-txt">
 <div class="vis-tag">Asset Management</div>
 <h3>CAFM-Grade Asset Register Across Every Building and Site</h3>
 <p>The asset management module in <strong>Odoo facility management software</strong> gives your team a full, searchable register of every piece of equipment across all properties — HVAC units, elevators, generators, electrical panels, fire systems, and more. Track service history, warranty dates, depreciation, and inspection status in one place.</p>
 <p>A well-executed <strong>Odoo implementation</strong> ensures automated service reminders are configured from day one — so no critical asset misses its inspection window and every compliance record is audit-ready.</p>
 </div>
