 <p style="max-width:700px">Demand for structured facility management is accelerating fast in <strong>Saudi Arabia</strong>, driven by Vision 2030 giga-projects and mandatory <strong>ZATCA Phase 2 e-invoicing</strong> for VAT-registered businesses. Etriplesoft configures Odoo FM deployments to meet Saudi compliance and reporting requirements from day one — the same certified delivery standard we apply across Egypt and the UAE.</p>

 <div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:rgba(252,211,77,.10);border:1.5px solid rgba(252,211,77,.3);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;margin-bottom:28px">
