 </div>

 <div class="whyg">
 <div class="whyc"><div class="wyn">10+</div><div class="wyt">Years ERP Experience</div><p class="wyd">Deep FM and maintenance implementation expertise across Egypt, UAE, and Saudi Arabia</p></div>
 <div class="whyc"><div class="wyn">250+</div><div class="wyt">Implementations Delivered</div><p class="wyd">Proven Odoo delivery track record across MENA region businesses of every size</p></div>
