<section class="sec">
<div class="wrap">
 <div class="eye">Overview</div>
 <h2>What Is Odoo HR Software?</h2>
 <p style="max-width:720px;font-size:17px"><strong>Odoo HR software</strong> is a fully integrated human resources management system that covers every stage of the employee lifecycle — from hiring and onboarding to payroll processing, attendance tracking, leave management, performance appraisals, and end-of-service calculations — all inside one connected ERP platform. Whether you need <strong>Odoo HR Egypt</strong>, <strong>Odoo HR UAE</strong>, or <strong>Odoo HR Saudi Arabia</strong>, Etriplesoft configures the right localization for your country from day one.</p>
 <p style="max-width:720px">Whether you run a 50-person trading company in Cairo, a multi-branch retail group in Dubai, or a large industrial group across Saudi Arabia, <strong>Odoo HR</strong> replaces fragmented spreadsheets, disconnected HR tools, and manual payroll processes with one intelligent system. HR managers gain real-time visibility over headcount, payroll costs, attendance compliance, and recruitment pipelines — without switching between platforms.</p>
 <p style="max-width:720px">At <strong>Etriplesoft</strong>, as a certified <strong>Odoo Gold Partner</strong>, our <a href="https://etriplesoft.com/odoo-implementation-process-by-etriplesoft/" style="color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600">Odoo implementation</a> service for HR is built around how MENA businesses actually manage their people. We configure Egyptian payroll localization, social insurance rules, biometric attendance, and Arabic payslips from day one — so your HR team goes live fully compliant without workarounds.</p>
 <a href="https://etriple.odoo.com/appointment/3" class="btn" style="margin-top:8px">Request a Free Demo →</a>
 <div class="qstrip">
 <div class="qs"><div class="qs-i">💰</div><div class="qs-t">Payroll Automation</div><p class="qs-p"><strong>Odoo HR software</strong> automates salary calculations, social insurance, income tax brackets, and end-of-service benefits with Egyptian localization built in.</p></div>
 <div class="qs"><div class="qs-i">🕐</div><div class="qs-t">Attendance &amp; Biometrics</div><p class="qs-p">Connect fingerprint and facial recognition devices directly to <strong>Odoo HR software</strong>. Attendance syncs to payroll automatically — zero manual import.</p></div>
 <div class="qs"><div class="qs-i">🌴</div><div class="qs-t">Leave Management</div><p class="qs-p">Employee self-service leave requests, manager approvals, and automatic balance tracking — fully paperless across all branches.</p></div>
 <div class="qs"><div class="qs-i">🎯</div><div class="qs-t">Recruitment &amp; Onboarding</div><p class="qs-p">Manage job postings, candidate pipelines, interview stages, and onboarding checklists — all connected to the employee record.</p></div>
