<!-- ══════════ CHALLENGES ══════════ -->
<section class="sec" style="background:var(--bg2)">
<div class="wrap">
 <div class="eye">The Problem</div>
 <h2>HR Challenges Odoo HR Software Solves for Egypt &amp; MENA Businesses</h2>
 <p style="max-width:660px">Growing businesses across Egypt, UAE, and Saudi Arabia share the same HR operational pressures. Here is exactly how <strong>Odoo HR software</strong> — properly configured by Etriplesoft — eliminates each one. Our <strong>Odoo HR Egypt</strong> clients automate payroll compliance, while our <strong>Odoo HR UAE</strong> and <strong>Odoo HR KSA</strong> clients gain full GOSI and WPS automation.</p>
 <div class="chg">
 <div class="chc"><div class="chi">💰</div><h3>Manual Payroll &amp; Compliance Errors</h3><p>Calculating Egyptian social insurance (14% employee / 26% employer), income tax brackets, and end-of-service benefits manually leads to costly errors every month. <strong>Odoo HR software</strong> automates every calculation with Egypt-specific localization built in from day one.</p></div>
 <div class="chc"><div class="chi">🕐</div><h3>Disconnected Attendance &amp; Payroll</h3><p>When biometric attendance data lives in a separate system, payroll teams spend hours importing and reconciling records before each payroll run. <strong>Odoo HR software</strong> connects your biometric devices directly — attendance syncs to payroll automatically, with no manual steps.</p></div>
 <div class="chc"><div class="chi">🌴</div><h3>Leave Management Chaos</h3><p>Managing leave requests across departments on WhatsApp, paper forms, or spreadsheets creates confusion, disputes, and compliance risk. <strong>Odoo HR software</strong> self-service portal lets employees request leave on mobile while managers approve with one click — all balances updated instantly.</p></div>
 <div class="chc"><div class="chi">📋</div><h3>No Centralized Employee Records</h3><p>Contracts, IDs, visa copies, and performance history scattered across folders and email chains makes audits and decisions slow. <strong>Odoo HR software</strong> centralizes every employee document, contract, and record in one searchable, access-controlled database.</p></div>
 <div class="chc"><div class="chi">🎯</div><h3>Slow Recruitment &amp; Onboarding</h3><p>Manual recruitment pipelines and paper onboarding checklists delay time-to-hire and create poor first impressions. <strong>Odoo HR software</strong> tracks every candidate from application to offer, and converts accepted candidates to employee records in one click.</p></div>
 <div class="chc"><div class="chi">📊</div><h3>No HR Visibility for Management</h3><p>Without real-time HR dashboards, management decisions on headcount, payroll cost, and performance rely on monthly reports that are always out of date. <strong>Odoo HR software</strong> delivers live analytics accessible to HR managers and executives on any device.</p></div>
 </div>
</div>
</section>

