<!-- ══════════ EGYPTIAN PAYROLL COMPLIANCE HOW-TO ══════════ -->
<section class="sec payroll-sec" id="payroll-guide">
<div class="wrap">
 <div class="eye">Egyptian Payroll Guide</div>
 <h2 style="color:#fff;letter-spacing:-0.02em">How Odoo HR Software Handles Egyptian Payroll Compliance</h2>
 <p style="max-width:640px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)">Step-by-step: how <strong style="color:#fff">Odoo HR software</strong> calculates Egyptian payroll correctly — social insurance, income tax, end-of-service benefits, and annual leave — all automated with Egypt-specific localization built into Odoo v17.</p>
 <div class="payroll-steps">
 <div class="payroll-step">
 <div class="payroll-num">1</div>
 <h3>Social Insurance Configuration</h3>
 <p>Odoo calculates both employee and employer social insurance shares based on the Social Insurance Reference Amount set per contract. Employee share is deducted automatically from the gross salary each payroll run.</p>
 <span class="stat-pill">Employee: 14% · Employer: 26%</span>
 </div>
 <div class="payroll-step">
 <div class="payroll-num">2</div>
 <h3>Income Tax Brackets</h3>
 <p>Egyptian income tax uses a progressive bracket system. Odoo's Egypt payroll localization applies the correct tax slab to each employee's taxable income automatically — no manual calculation or spreadsheet required.</p>
 <span class="stat-pill">Progressive brackets — auto-applied</span>
 </div>
 <div class="payroll-step">
 <div class="payroll-num">3</div>
 <h3>Annual Leave &amp; Sick Leave</h3>
 <p>Egyptian Labor Law grants 21 days annual leave. Sick leave rules (fully paid first 30 days, then partial deductions) are built into the Odoo localization and calculate automatically on each payslip based on actual leave taken.</p>
 <span class="stat-pill">21 days annual · Sick leave automated</span>
 </div>
 <div class="payroll-step">
 <div class="payroll-num">4</div>
 <h3>End-of-Service Benefits (EOSB)</h3>
 <p>Odoo calculates end-of-service entitlement using the standard Egyptian formula: (Wage + Allowances ÷ 30) × Number of Leave Days ÷ 12. The provision accrues monthly and appears on the payslip automatically.</p>
 <span class="stat-pill">EOSB provision auto-accrued monthly</span>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:40px">
 <a href="https://etriple.odoo.com/appointment/3" class="btn btn-cyan">Get Egypt-Configured Odoo HR — Free Demo →</a>
 </div>
</div>
</section>

