 <span class="wtag">🏛️ Professional Services Firms</span>
 <span class="wtag">🌍 Multi-Entity Groups</span>
 <span class="wtag">🏘️ Real Estate &amp; Property</span>
 <span class="wtag">🔌 Technology &amp; Services</span>
 </div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- WHY ETRIPLESOFT -->
<section class="sec">
<div class="wrap">
 <div class="eye">Why Choose Us</div>
 <h2>Why Finance Teams Choose Etriplesoft — Odoo Gold Partner</h2>
 <p style="max-width:700px">Etriplesoft is a certified <strong>Odoo Gold Partner</strong> with proven delivery experience in <strong>Odoo for Accounting</strong> across Egypt, UAE, and Saudi Arabia.</p>
 <p style="max-width:700px">We do not offer generic ERP rollouts. Every Odoo implementation we deliver is precisely configured to the accounting workflows, reporting requirements, and tax compliance obligations of your specific business.</p>
 <p style="max-width:700px">Our certified consultants, developers, and finance specialists guide your organisation from initial scoping and system design through to data migration, team training, and ongoing post-implementation support. Our structured Odoo Implementation Process process ensures strong team adoption, a clean go-live, and reliable financial data from the very first day your system is live.</p>
 <div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:rgba(252,211,77,.10);border:1.5px solid rgba(252,211,77,.3);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;margin-bottom:28px">
