 </div>
 <a href="https://www.odoo.com/partners/e-triplesoft-10996064" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="margin-left:12px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;color:#FCD34D;white-space:nowrap">View Profile →</a>
 </div>
 <div class="whyg">
