 <!-- Why Section -->
 <section id="why">
 <h2>Why Educational Institutions Outgrow Spreadsheets</h2>
 <p>Running a school, college, or training institute is no longer a clerical job. Between admission season, tuition invoicing, timetable reshuffles, bus route changes, parent calls, and library overdues, administrators juggle a dozen disconnected tools — Excel for fees, WhatsApp for parents, a paper ledger for library books, a notebook for transport routes. The result is predictable: lost records, delayed invoices, angry parents, and audit headaches at the end of every academic year.</p>
 <p>We've seen this pattern repeatedly across institutions using <strong>school ERP software Egypt</strong>, the GCC, and beyond. The <strong>Odoo Education Management System</strong>, implemented by E-TripleSoft on your Odoo Enterprise database, solves this once and for all — a single application that runs every academic and administrative process end-to-end, with dedicated portals for Admins, Teachers, Students, and Parents, and full Arabic localization.</p>
 <div class="card-grid">
 <div class="card"><span class="card-icon">📋</span><h3>Scattered Admissions</h3><p>Paper enquiry forms, Excel trackers, and separate enrollment spreadsheets mean duplicate entry and lost applicants. The ERP runs Enquiry → Application → Verification → Enrollment as one continuous flow.</p></div>
 <div class="card"><span class="card-icon">💰</span><h3>Fee Chaos</h3><p>Tuition, transport, library, and lunch fees live in different sheets. The integrated Fee Management generates grade-wise structures, invoices, and tracks overdues automatically in Odoo Accounting.</p></div>
 <div class="card"><span class="card-icon">📞</span><h3>Parent Communication Gaps</h3><p>Parents call the office for every grade, fee, or absence. The Parent Portal gives them 24/7 self-service — view grades, pay fees, check attendance, switch between siblings.</p></div>
 <div class="card"><span class="card-icon">🔒</span><h3>Siloed Records</h3><p>Student history, library borrows, transport route, fee receipts — all in separate systems. Odoo links every record to one student profile, auditable from admission to graduation.</p></div>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section id="overview">
 <h2>What Is the Odoo Education Management System?</h2>
 <p>The <strong>Odoo Education Management System</strong> is a comprehensive, all-in-one <strong>education ERP software</strong> that runs natively on Odoo Enterprise — compatible across current Odoo versions. Unlike fragmented point solutions that bolt together a student database with a separate fee module and another for library, the <strong>Odoo school management system</strong> provides a <strong>single, unified ERP</strong> where every student record, every invoice, every library issue, and every bus route is linked through one database.</p>
 <p>The module delivers four distinct role-based experiences from the same installation: an all-powerful <strong>Administration Dashboard</strong>, a productivity-focused <strong>Teacher Portal</strong>, an engaging <strong>Student Portal</strong>, and a transparent <strong>Parent Portal</strong>. Every stakeholder sees exactly what they need — nothing more, nothing less — and the entire system communicates through Odoo's native chatter, calendar, and notification engine.</p>
 <div class="case-highlight">
 <h3>⚡ One Database. Four Portals. Zero Duplication.</h3>
 <p>From the first admission enquiry to the final graduation transcript, every action lives in one Odoo database. Parents pay fees that instantly post to Odoo Accounting. Teachers mark attendance that instantly appears in the parent portal. Librarians issue a book that automatically links to the student profile. There is no import, no export, no reconciliation.</p>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section id="lifecycle">
 <h2>The Admission-to-Graduation Lifecycle — End to End</h2>
 <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The <strong>Odoo school management system</strong> tracks every student from the first enquiry through enrollment, academic progression, and final graduation — all within a single database that your entire institution shares.</p>
 <p>Every module of the ERP is designed around one continuous academic journey. A single enquiry becomes an application, becomes an enrollment, generates a fee structure, assigns a timetable, tracks attendance and grades, and ultimately produces an academic transcript — all inside the same system, with every relationship explicit and auditable.</p>
 <div class="workflow">
 <div class="phase"><div class="phase-header"><strong>01 Admission Enquiry</strong><span class="phase-num">Website form → CRM</span></div><p>Prospective families submit the admission enquiry form from the school website or at the front desk. The ERP captures applicant details, guardian contacts, prior school, and grade sought. Every enquiry becomes a traceable record, not a forgotten paper form.</p></div>
 <div class="phase"><div class="phase-header"><strong>02 Application &amp; Verification</strong><span class="phase-num">Document review</span></div><p>Admissions staff verify birth certificates, transfer letters, and medical records against configurable application fields. The application status moves through Submitted → Under Review → Verified → Approved, with every decision stamped against a user and a date.</p></div>
 <div class="phase"><div class="phase-header"><strong>03 Enrollment &amp; Class Allocation</strong><span class="phase-num">Session + grade assignment</span></div><p>Verified applicants are enrolled into a specific session (academic year), grade, and section. The system auto-generates the grade-specific fee structure, allocates the student to class sections, and provisions portal access for the student and their parents.</p></div>
 <div class="phase"><div class="phase-header"><strong>04 Fee Generation &amp; Collection</strong><span class="phase-num">Invoices + online payment</span></div><p>Tuition, transport, library, lunch, and registration fees are bundled into the student's invoice based on their grade and services. Parents pay online through the portal; payments reconcile to Odoo Accounting automatically with full receipt history.</p></div>
 <div class="phase"><div class="phase-header"><strong>05 Academic Delivery</strong><span class="phase-num">Timetable, attendance &amp; grades</span></div><p>Classes appear on the student, teacher, and parent calendars. Teachers mark attendance and grade assignments from their portal. Students submit assignments, track grades, and see attendance history in real time. Parents monitor everything from their portal.</p></div>
 <div class="phase"><div class="phase-header"><strong>06 Services &amp; Support</strong><span class="phase-num">Library + Transport + Scholarships</span></div><p>Library issues and returns, bus route assignments, scholarship applications, and disciplinary records all link back to the student's profile. Every service the student consumes is recorded against one unified record.</p></div>
 <div class="phase"><div class="phase-header"><strong>07 Transcripts &amp; Graduation</strong><span class="phase-num">One-click generation</span></div><p>At year-end or graduation, the system generates complete academic transcripts — grades, attendance, completed classes, personal details, and institution information — as downloadable PDFs. Alumni records stay in the database for future verifications.</p></div>
 </div>
