 <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">The <strong>Odoo school management system</strong> handles the full admission pipeline — from the first online enquiry to classroom assignment — without any external tool or manual hand-off.</p>
 <p>Admission season is the most operationally intense time in any school's calendar. The ERP turns it into a clean, auditable workflow — every prospective family tracked from the first enquiry through to a fully enrolled student with assigned classes, fee structure, and portal access.</p>
