 <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">In the <strong>Odoo school management system</strong>, teachers are proper HR employee records linked natively to payroll, time off, and appraisals — not a standalone staff list disconnected from the rest of the business.</p>
 <p>Teachers are not a footnote in an education ERP — they are half the institution. The module treats every teacher as a proper record linked to Odoo's HR module, giving you one place to manage teaching staff alongside the rest of your workforce. Payroll, time off, performance, and academic allocation all live in the same database.</p>
 <div class="bento-grid">
 <div class="module-card"><h3>🪪 Teacher Profiles Linked to HR</h3><ul><li>Each teacher is an Odoo Employee with full HR record</li><li>Contract, department, manager, and joining date tracked natively</li><li>Subjects taught and grade levels captured per teacher</li><li>Portal access provisioned with one click</li></ul></div>
 <div class="module-card"><h3>📆 Personal Teacher Dashboard</h3><ul><li>Today's classes with time, location, and subject</li><li>Pending assignments to evaluate and attendance to mark</li><li>Upcoming schedule for the week ahead</li><li>Quick links to the notice board and lesson tools</li></ul></div>
 <div class="module-card"><h3>👥 Primary &amp; Secondary Assignment</h3><ul><li>Assign a primary teacher and secondary teachers per class</li><li>Co-teaching and substitute scenarios handled cleanly</li><li>Teachers see only the classes they are allocated to</li><li>Class history per teacher for performance reviews</li></ul></div>
 <div class="module-card"><h3>✔️ Teacher-Side Workflows</h3><ul><li>Mark class and student attendance from the portal</li><li>Approve or reject student discipline and service-hour entries</li><li>Post to the notice board with audience targeting</li><li>Record pickup/drop-off for assigned transport routes</li></ul></div>
 </div>
 <p style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Because teachers are HR Employees under the hood, everything Odoo offers HR — payroll, time off, appraisals, expenses — slots in without any integration work. Your principal manages the academic dimension; HR manages the employment dimension; both see the same record.</p>
