 <div class="module-card"><h3>🗺️ Route Planning</h3><ul><li>Define routes with ordered pickup and drop-off stops</li><li>Set time per stop and total route duration</li><li>Assign students to specific routes with their home stop</li><li>Add or remove pickup points without touching student records</li></ul></div>
