 <section id="dashboard">
 <h2>Unified Administration Dashboard — Run the School from One Screen</h2>
 <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">The <strong>Odoo Education Management System</strong> brings every administrative function onto one live dashboard — no switching between apps, no duplicate data entry.</p>
 <p>The administrator dashboard is the command centre of the entire institution. From a single screen, the admin sees live enrollment counts, fee collection progress, ongoing and upcoming classes, library activity, and pending admission applications. Every tile is clickable — drilling from a summary number into the exact records behind it.</p>
 <div class="card-grid">
 <div class="card"><span class="card-icon">🎯</span><h3>Configure Once, Run All Year</h3><p>Academic sessions, grade scales, class locations, fee elements, grading weights — all defined at the start of the session and applied automatically to every downstream workflow.</p></div>
 <div class="card"><span class="card-icon">🖱️</span><h3>One-Click Shortcuts</h3><p>Jump from the dashboard to enrollments, classes, timetables, students, teachers, assignments, transport, library, transcripts, or fee management in a single click.</p></div>
 <div class="card"><span class="card-icon">📈</span><h3>Track Academic Pulse</h3><p>See how students are performing across grades, which teachers have the fullest schedules, and which fees are still outstanding — without running a single report.</p></div>
 <div class="card"><span class="card-icon">🔐</span><h3>Full Configuration Control</h3><p>Admins own every configuration lever — from academic sessions and grade scales to custom grading formulas, class locations, and application form fields.</p></div>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section id="enrollment">
 <h2>Smart Enrollment Management — From Enquiry to Class Roster in One Flow</h2>
 <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">The <strong>Odoo school management system</strong> handles the full admission pipeline — from the first online enquiry to classroom assignment — without any external tool or manual hand-off.</p>
 <p>Admission season is the most operationally intense time in any school's calendar. The ERP turns it into a clean, auditable workflow — every prospective family tracked from the first enquiry through to a fully enrolled student with assigned classes, fee structure, and portal access.</p>
 <div class="pipeline">
 <span class="pipe-stage start">Enquiry</span>
 <span class="pipe-arrow">→</span>
 <span class="pipe-stage">Application</span>
 <span class="pipe-arrow">→</span>
 <span class="pipe-stage">Verification</span>
 <span class="pipe-arrow">→</span>
 <span class="pipe-stage hold">Approval</span>
 <span class="pipe-arrow">→</span>
 <span class="pipe-stage done">Enrolled ✓</span>
 </div>
